# One pre-shared secret per runner: 40 hex chars. The first 16 are the runner's identifier and
# determine its UUID (the 16 chars as hex-encoded ASCII); the rest is the secret.
# `make prerequisites` generates these; `make runners` registers them with Forgejo.
token-0=REPLACE_ME
uuid-0=REPLACE_ME
token-1=REPLACE_ME
uuid-1=REPLACE_ME
